sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Creator
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as API service
  participant G as Originality Guard
  participant DB as Database
  participant SCH as Scheduler
  participant YT as YouTube API

  C->>UI: request publish
  UI->>API: POST /publications
  API->>G: evaluate(project)
  G->>DB: fetch channel back catalogue
  DB-->>G: prior scripts + embeddings
  G->>G: similarity, human input time, template check

  alt score below threshold
    G-->>API: BLOCKED + reason
    API-->>UI: publish disabled, remedy shown
    UI-->>C: "add original commentary"
  else score acceptable
    G-->>API: PASS + audit record
    API->>DB: persist OriginalityCheck
    API->>DB: create Publication (scheduled)
    API-->>UI: scheduled

    SCH->>API: due publications
    API->>YT: videos.insert (~100 units)
    YT-->>API: videoId
    API->>YT: set thumbnail, captions
    API->>YT: set disclosure flag
    API->>DB: mark published

    opt quota exceeded
      YT-->>API: 403 quotaExceeded
      API->>API: exponential backoff, requeue
    end
  end
